  <title>Egutegi-elementuak bilatzea</title>

<section id="quick-search">
  <title>Bilaketa azkarra</title>

  <p>In the Calendar view, you can quickly search for appointments and meetings
  either by summary or by category.</p>

  <p>Laburpenaren arabera bilatzea:</p>

  <steps>
    <item>
      <p>Egin klik bilaketa-ikonoan <media type="image" mime="image/png" its:translate="no" src="figures/search-icon.png"/> goitibeherako zerrenda zabaltzeko.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Hautatu bilaketa-baldintza zerrendan.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Sartu bilatu nahi den testua eta sakatu <key>Enter</key>.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p><app>Evolution</app>-ek bilaketa-emaitzak bistaratuko ditu..</p>
    </item>
  </steps>

  <p>Kategoriaren arabera bilatzea:</p>

  <steps>
    <item>
      <p>Egin klik <gui>Erakutsi</gui> goitibeherako zerrendan.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Hautatu kategoria zerrendan.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p><app>Evolution</app>-ek bilaketa-emaitzak bistaratuko ditu..</p>
    </item>
  </steps>

  <p>To go through the results you can use the two arrow buttons next to the
  search field. This searches in currently enabled calendars. It searches from
  the currently selected day in the given direction, in a range of 10 years by
  default.</p>

  <p>If you want to set several search conditions, you should use an Advanced
  search, which is described below.</p>

</section>

